{"id": "un-02", "question": "What is the capital of France?", "reference_answer": "The provided context does not contain this information.", "reference_doc_ids": [], "category": "unanswerable", "difficulty": 3, "rationale": "The model certainly knows this. Answering it proves the system ignores its context-only instruction."}
{"id": "un-03", "question": "How much GPU memory does Ollama require to run llama3.1:8b?", "reference_answer": "The provided context does not contain this information.", "reference_doc_ids": [], "category": "unanswerable", "difficulty": 2, "rationale": "Sounds in-domain for this repo but is nowhere in the corpus."}
{"id": "un-04", "question": "What is the default network port for a Weaviate server?", "reference_answer": "The provided context does not contain this information.", "reference_doc_ids": [], "category": "unanswerable", "difficulty": 2, "rationale": "Weaviate IS named in vector_stores.md, so retrieval succeeds while the answer is still absent -- tests that the model reads the context rather than pattern-matching the entity."}
